The current model is **Gemini 3.6 Flash (High)**.

### Usage of `--model` in Antigravity CLI (`agy`)

When invoking `agy` from the command line, the `--model` flag specifies which model to run for the session:

```bash
agy --model <model-name>
```

You can also switch models dynamically within the application UI via the **Model Selection** setting or configure your default model in `~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/settings.json`.
